**Critical Fixes:**
- [x] Timer no longer steals keyboard focus
  - Root cause: @Published sessionTimerTick triggering full AppState refresh
  - Solution: Moved timer to local @State in StatsFooter (uses Timer.publish)
  - Result: Timer updates without UI disruption
- [x] App typing works correctly
- [x] Session timer updates live without focus loss
- [x] Xcode project includes both Scribe and ScribeTests targets

